# terraform
terraform/.terraform/
terraform/*.tfstate
terraform/*.tfstate.*
# .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT ignored: it pins the exact provider
# versions, so CI and a laptop resolve the same ones. Without it a provider
# release breaks an apply with no change on our side.
*.tfvars

